WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.416
All right, boys and girls, we have
arrived at Kawaguchiko.

00:00:59.041 --> 00:01:00.625
Kawaguchiko, Fujikawaguchiko.

00:01:25.333 --> 00:01:28.708
So we just checked in at our
hotel called...

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:32.291
I'll...

00:01:33.083 --> 00:01:34.458
I'll write the name somewhere.

00:01:34.708 --> 00:01:38.583
So far, I'm actually very, very
pleasantly surprised.

00:01:38.833 --> 00:01:40.916
I booked it pretty much last minute.

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:45.375
Now, it doesn't have sort of the 
Mount Fuji view by the lake,

00:01:45.833 --> 00:01:49.583
But it does have the lake view, and it's a
very pretty lake in my opinion.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.458
And honestly, it's only like 
probably a 10, 20 minutes walk

00:01:53.666 --> 00:01:55.208
to the northern side

00:01:55.208 --> 00:01:58.250
of sort of like the little
lake area we're in,

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:03.000
and from there, I'm pretty sure you
can get like a view of Mount Fuji.

00:02:03.083 --> 00:02:04.375
So we're probably gonna do that.

00:02:04.458 --> 00:02:06.500
We got this Japanese traditional room.

00:02:06.583 --> 00:02:08.083
It was the only room they have left,

00:02:08.083 --> 00:02:10.041
so it was a little bit more 
on the expensive end,

00:02:10.208 --> 00:02:11.458
I think it's quite worth it.

00:02:11.541 --> 00:02:14.708
So we're just gonna like pack out
some few stuff and then head out.

00:02:14.708 --> 00:02:17.583
Our full first day
in Fuji starts tomorrow.

00:02:17.583 --> 00:02:20.000
So yeah, excited to be at Fuji
for the first time.

00:02:20.458 --> 00:02:24.458
Glad to be here and spend the next
two days here to explore.

00:02:52.416 --> 00:02:55.583
All right guys, so just spent 
a good hour or more

00:02:55.791 --> 00:02:58.666
just taking different shots of Mount Fuji

00:02:58.875 --> 00:03:01.333
So it's now time to head back, 
find some dinner,

00:03:02.041 --> 00:03:03.000
probably some pizza.

00:03:03.208 --> 00:03:05.291
I found like a really decent pizza spot.

00:03:05.583 --> 00:03:09.000
I've just been having Japanese
food for the entire trip.

00:03:09.125 --> 00:03:12.416
So I'll be happy with some Italiano.

00:03:12.833 --> 00:03:14.958
Lisa, what did you think of Mount Fuji?

00:03:15.541 --> 00:03:16.291
Was it worth it?

00:03:17.083 --> 00:03:17.666
Yes,

00:03:17.791 --> 00:03:20.500
yeah, it's a big thumbs up from us.

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:23.666
We've all seen images and videos
of Mount Fuji.

00:03:24.041 --> 00:03:27.666
But you don't really get 
a proper sense of anything 

00:03:27.875 --> 00:03:29.875
unless you experience it in real life.

00:03:29.875 --> 00:03:32.041
So I think that's what travel
is all about.

00:03:32.125 --> 00:03:35.291
You can see all the videos that I make,
the videos that other creators make.

00:03:35.541 --> 00:03:38.333
In the end, you really have to
go there yourself guys.

00:03:38.541 --> 00:03:40.041
You have to experience this yourself.

00:03:40.125 --> 00:03:41.833
It's just not the same
watching a video.

00:03:41.833 --> 00:03:43.500
So travel to Japan,

00:03:43.666 --> 00:03:44.583
come to Fuji,

00:03:45.166 --> 00:03:45.958
that's an order.

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:49.208
The pizza restaurant is closed.

00:03:49.625 --> 00:03:50.791
I have to find something else.

00:03:50.791 --> 00:03:53.208
And now we found a small ramen shop.

00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:55.208
They're just making ramen out
of a little truck here.

00:03:55.291 --> 00:03:59.541
I think they serve Hiroshima
style tonkotsu ramen.

00:03:59.625 --> 00:04:02.000
So looking forward to it.

00:04:09.458 --> 00:04:11.750
After a chilly, chilly day...

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:14.250
Nothing beats warm ramen.

00:04:14.625 --> 00:04:16.500
Hiroshima style ramen,

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:17.416
tonkotsu,

00:04:17.416 --> 00:04:19.708
Lisa got the lobster version,

00:04:19.916 --> 00:04:22.500
which is a little bit too fishy for me 
when I tasted it,

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:24.041
but still very good.

00:04:39.041 --> 00:04:40.833
Good morning, everyone.

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:43.583
This is our first full day.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.541
We're heading towards a bike rental shop.

00:04:46.958 --> 00:04:50.250
And hopefully we can rent
two bikes for today.

00:04:50.666 --> 00:04:53.000
So we can do some exploring, just
biking around the lake.

00:04:53.416 --> 00:04:54.250
Look at that.

00:04:54.458 --> 00:04:55.708
Mr. Fuji.

00:04:57.083 --> 00:04:58.541
Big boy Fujisan.

00:04:59.083 --> 00:05:02.791
The weather is super nice,
no clouds in sight.

00:05:02.916 --> 00:05:06.083
So can't ask for better weather
and a better day,

00:05:06.291 --> 00:05:08.500
to start our full day of exploring.

00:05:08.875 --> 00:05:11.708
All right, guys, so this is
our bikes we just got.

00:05:11.791 --> 00:05:13.833
Got the bikes for the full day.

00:05:14.166 --> 00:05:18.791
Gotta return it before the shop closes
at around 8 PM, I believe.

00:05:26.583 --> 00:05:28.208
Boys and girls, rent a bike, honestly.

00:05:29.583 --> 00:05:30.375
Rent a bike.

00:08:34.541 --> 00:08:35.375
This is the...

00:08:36.208 --> 00:08:37.375
Apple strawberry

00:08:37.666 --> 00:08:40.750
and Lisa got the vanilla blueberry one.

00:08:44.708 --> 00:08:46.416
I will give this...

00:08:46.416 --> 00:08:48.000
7.5 out of 10.

00:08:48.375 --> 00:08:48.875
Yes, it's melting.

00:08:49.916 --> 00:08:51.083
7.5 out of 10.

00:08:51.166 --> 00:08:52.333
The blueberry one.

00:08:54.208 --> 00:08:55.291
Oh my God, so much better, guys.

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:56.875
Get the blueberry vanilla one.

00:09:28.083 --> 00:09:28.500
Welcome back.

00:09:28.583 --> 00:09:31.666
This is our last full day here
in the Fuji area.

00:09:32.041 --> 00:09:34.541
Our first stop of the day
is Oshino Hakkai,

00:09:34.625 --> 00:09:36.291
which is this small

00:09:36.291 --> 00:09:38.625
sort of picturesque little village.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.958
It's very pretty, very scenic, 
it's worth the stop

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:44.708
It's definitely a little bit of a side
trip outside of Lake Kawaguchiko,

00:09:44.791 --> 00:09:46.958
but I think 
if you're spending two days here,

00:09:47.083 --> 00:09:48.000
definitely worth doing.

00:09:48.458 --> 00:09:50.041
Anyways, let's check out

00:09:50.666 --> 00:09:51.708
Oshino Hakkai.

